# game/case09.rpy:63
translate schinese press_kaguya_1_5a7bbf79:

    # you "Which five chores?"
    you "哪五件差事？"

# game/case09.rpy:64
translate schinese press_kaguya_1_3399144f:

    # kaguya "Little things. A dragon's jewel, a fire-rat robe. The usual."
    kaguya "小事而已。龙首之珠，火鼠裘。老一套。"

# game/case09.rpy:66
translate schinese press_kaguya_1_cf1232a4:

    # eiki "The usual for whom?"
    eiki "对谁来说是老一套？"

# game/case09.rpy:70
translate schinese press_kaguya_2_315cafce:

    # you "Surprised? Why?"
    you "吃惊？为什么？"

# game/case09.rpy:72
translate schinese press_kaguya_2_df01c73a:

    # kaguya "Nobody has finished my list in a thousand years. It's been a while."
    kaguya "一千年来没人完成过我的清单。好久没见了。"

# game/case09.rpy:76
translate schinese press_kaguya_3_6d0818cc:

    # you "Why not? She finished all five."
    you "为什么？她五件全完成了。"

# game/case09.rpy:77
translate schinese press_kaguya_3_76b6752c:

    # kaguya "Ah, but finishing was never really the point. Add this to my testimony."
    kaguya "啊，但完成从来就不是重点。把这句加进我的证词。"

# game/case09.rpy:81
translate schinese press_kaguya_4_65bc0e33:

    # you "The moon wasn't on the list. When did you add it?"
    you "清单上没有月亮。你什么时候加上的？"

# game/case09.rpy:83
translate schinese press_kaguya_4_156e1420:

    # kaguya "This morning. After she finished the other five. Obviously."
    kaguya "今天早上。在她完成另外五件之后。理所当然。"

# game/case09.rpy:85
translate schinese press_kaguya_4_0fe2b220:

    # eiki "So the finish line moved the moment she reached it."
    eiki "也就是说，她刚到终点线，终点线就挪走了。"

# game/case09.rpy:96
translate schinese case9_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "肃静。彼岸逻辑法庭现在开庭。"

# game/case09.rpy:98
translate schinese case9_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告呢？"

# game/case09.rpy:99
translate schinese case9_5ce059df:

    # komachi "She sent word, boss. She'll arrive when she feels like it."
    komachi "她捎来话了，四季大人。她说想来的时候自然会来。"

# game/case09.rpy:100
translate schinese case9_5c746e50:

    # eiki "Bring her in. Now."
    eiki "带她进来。马上。"

# game/case09.rpy:101
translate schinese case9_7d10e9c3:

    # komachi "...She feels like it now."
    komachi "……她现在想来了。"

# game/case09.rpy:104
translate schinese case9_7887afd8:

    # kaguya "Kaguya Houraisan, princess of Eientei. How charming. A courtroom."
    kaguya "永远亭的公主，蓬莱山辉夜。真有意思。法庭呢。"

# game/case09.rpy:107
translate schinese case9_46a91cf7:

    # eiki "The charge: refusing your assistant, Reisen, the week off you promised her."
    eiki "罪名：拒绝给助手铃仙你答应过的一周假期。"

# game/case09.rpy:110
translate schinese case9_5d651121:

    # kaguya "Promised? I set her a few little tasks. She simply hasn't finished them."
    kaguya "答应？我只是给她布置了几件小任务。她只是还没完成而已。"

# game/case09.rpy:114
translate schinese case9_159a5823:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. A fair test keeps its rules from start to finish."
    eiki "见习法官。公平的考验从头到尾规则不变。"

# game/case09.rpy:115
translate schinese case9_a1bb9f82:

    # eiki "When the finish line moves every time someone reaches it, the race was never fair."
    eiki "每当有人抵达，终点线就挪走，那这场比赛从来就不公平。"

# game/case09.rpy:131
translate schinese case9_450b8965:

    # kaguya_t "I told Reisen she could take a week off if she finished five chores."
    kaguya_t "我跟铃仙说过，完成五件差事就能休一周假。"

# game/case09.rpy:132
translate schinese case9_c2ac9ddc:

    # kaguya_t "Yesterday she brought me all five. I admit I was surprised."
    kaguya_t "昨天她把五样全拿来了。我承认我很吃惊。"

# game/case09.rpy:133
translate schinese case9_0649c7b5:

    # kaguya_t "But she still hasn't earned her week off."
    kaguya_t "但她还是没挣到那一周假期。"

# game/case09.rpy:137
translate schinese case9_cc48e40d:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. She has had a thousand years of practice."
    eiki "证人交给你了，见习法官。她可练了一千年。"

# game/case09.rpy:151
translate schinese case9_cross_58e06995:

    # eiki "Again. The princess has time. So, apparently, do we."
    eiki "再来一次。公主有的是时间。看来我们也有。"

# game/case09.rpy:162
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_33e34ebd:

    # you "This list has your signature. Five chores, then a week off. All five are ticked."
    you "这份清单上有你的签名。五件差事，然后休一周。五件全打了勾。"

# game/case09.rpy:163
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_ecfaa82a:

    # you "Reisen reached the line you drew. You moved it the moment she got there."
    you "铃仙到达了你画的线。她一到，你就把线挪走了。"

# game/case09.rpy:166
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_b42792a1:

    # kaguya "...My signature. In ink. How very unlike me."
    kaguya "……我的签名。还是墨迹。真不像我。"

# game/case09.rpy:170
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_0b2e0098:

    # eiki "Moving the goalposts. Change the test as soon as it is passed, and no answer is ever enough."
    eiki "移动球门。考验一通过就改，那任何答案都永远不够。"

# game/case09.rpy:171
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_d64a2b08:

    # eiki "A promise judged by new rules is not a promise. It is a trap."
    eiki "用新规则评判的承诺不是承诺，是陷阱。"

# game/case09.rpy:178
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_dc9e9248:

    # eiki "Defendant Kaguya Houraisan. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告蓬莱山辉夜。本庭判决你……"

# game/case09.rpy:189
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_7af39709:

    # eiki "Sentence: Reisen takes her week off, starting today. You will do her chores."
    eiki "判决：铃仙从今天起休假一周。她的差事由你来做。"

# game/case09.rpy:192
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_abeac172:

    # kaguya "Me? Chores? ...Do I have to fetch my own tea?"
    kaguya "我？做差事？……我得自己倒茶吗？"

# game/case09.rpy:195
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_5455e8c7:

    # eiki "Every cup. Bailiff."
    eiki "每一杯都是。法警。"

# game/case09.rpy:196
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "这就去，四季大人。"

# game/case09.rpy:211
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_7fda5bef:

    # mokou "KAGUYAAA!"
    mokou "辉夜——！"

# game/case09.rpy:212
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_b9f4317c:

    # kaguya "Oh no. Not now. Not in court."
    kaguya "糟了。别是现在。这里是法庭。"

# game/case09.rpy:213
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_f5cfe6d1:

    # mokou "Fujiwara no Mokou. Heard you finally lost something. Thought I'd help you lose more."
    mokou "藤原妹红。听说你终于输了一回。我来帮你多输点。"

# game/case09.rpy:214
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_e5bdca6e:

    # eiki "This is a courtroom. The defendant is in this court's custody."
    eiki "这里是法庭。被告由本庭看管。"

# game/case09.rpy:215
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_31614309:

    # mokou "Great. I'll take custody."
    mokou "好啊。那我来看管。"

# game/case09.rpy:227
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_53f15046:

    # kaguya "Ow! Ow! My face is priceless!"
    kaguya "疼！疼！我的脸可是无价的！"

# game/case09.rpy:228
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_a2e3c33a:

    # mokou "So's this. Free of charge."
    mokou "这顿揍也是。不收钱。"

# game/case09.rpy:239
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_67271a1c:

    # kaguya "Eirin! Somebody! Bailiff!"
    kaguya "永琳！来人啊！法警！"

# game/case09.rpy:242
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_88995a40:

    # komachi "...Want me to chase them, boss?"
    komachi "……要我去追吗，四季大人？"

# game/case09.rpy:243
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_0f642d8c:

    # eiki "No. They have been doing this for a thousand years. They will be back by dinner."
    eiki "不必。她们这样闹了一千年了。晚饭前就会回来。"

# game/case09.rpy:244
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_69add51b:

    # eiki "Reisen's week off begins regardless. Court is adjourned."
    eiki "铃仙的假期照样开始。退庭。"

# game/case09.rpy:245
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_cebf22fd:

    # komachi "That's the whole docket, boss."
    komachi "案卷全部审完了，四季大人。"

# game/case09.rpy:246
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_71bf8c82:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Your work was... more than acceptable."
    eiki "见习法官。你的表现……不止及格。"

# game/case09.rpy:247
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_42d7cba4:

    # komachi "She's never said that before. Not once."
    komachi "她以前从没这么说过。一次都没有。"

# game/case09.rpy:248
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case09.rpy:249
translate schinese case9_breakthrough_bd395515:

    # komachi "Escorting myself out."
    komachi "我把自己护送出去。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case09.rpy:10
    old "Signed Chore List"
    new "签了名的差事清单"

    # game/case09.rpy:10
    old "\"Five chores, then a week off.\" Signed: Kaguya Houraisan. All five ticked."
    new "“五件差事，然后休一周。”签名：蓬莱山辉夜。五件全打勾。"

    # game/case09.rpy:12
    old "The Five Treasures"
    new "五件宝物"

    # game/case09.rpy:12
    old "A dragon's jewel, a fire-rat robe, a stone bowl, a jewelled branch, a swallow's shell."
    new "龙首之珠、火鼠裘、佛前石钵、蓬莱玉枝、燕子安贝。"

    # game/case09.rpy:14
    old "New Chore List"
    new "新的差事清单"

    # game/case09.rpy:14
    old "Written this morning, unsigned: \"Also: the moon. Bring it here.\""
    new "今早写的，没有签名：“另加：月亮。拿到这里来。”"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "The Five Impossible Chores"
    new "五道难题"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "I told Reisen she could take a week off if she finished five chores."
    new "我跟铃仙说过，完成五件差事就能休一周假。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "An offer is not an argument. Look for where she reasons."
    new "承诺不是论证。找她推理的地方。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Yesterday she brought me all five. I admit I was surprised."
    new "昨天她把五样全拿来了。我承认我很吃惊。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Even the defendant admits the chores were done. Keep going."
    new "连被告都承认差事完成了。继续。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "But she still hasn't earned her week off."
    new "但她还是没挣到那一周假期。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Why not? Ask her before you object."
    new "为什么不行？反对之前先问她。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Now she must also bring me the moon. Then the week off is hers. Probably."
    new "现在她还得把月亮给我拿来。然后假期就归她了。大概吧。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "No either-or here. Just a finish line that keeps sliding away."
    new "这里没有非此即彼。只有一条不断往后滑的终点线。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Her reason isn't her conclusion. Her rules simply change every time Reisen meets them."
    new "她的理由不是她的结论。只是铃仙每次达标，她的规则就变。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "She isn't misquoting Reisen. She's rewriting her own deal."
    new "她没有曲解铃仙的话。她是在改写自己的约定。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "No rule built from one example. Just a promise with a brand-new clause."
    new "没有从一个例子造出的规律。只有一个多了新条款的承诺。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "No crowd involved. Just one princess and an ever-growing chore list."
    new "没有人群参与。只有一位公主和一份越来越长的差事清单。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Nothing here is mistaken for a cause. The test itself moved."
    new "这里没有把什么误当成原因。是考验本身挪动了。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "She isn't attacking Reisen. She's attacking the finish line."
    new "她没有攻击铃仙。她攻击的是终点线。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "Nobody's blaming anyone back. She just keeps adding chores."
    new "没人反过来指责谁。她只是不停加差事。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "No chain of disasters predicted. Only a chain of chores."
    new "没有预言灾难连锁。只有一连串差事。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "She isn't citing an expert. She's changing her own rules."
    new "她没有援引专家。她在改自己的规则。"

    # game/case09.rpy:17
    old "That doesn't show what was agreed. Find the deal as it was first made."
    new "这证明不了当初约定了什么。找出最初的约定。"

